    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"take a step back\"... i dont even know what that means anymore. i've tried everything. i try to do what they want, i try to be the person they need me to be, but it just makes the walls feel closer. it feels like there is no \"me\" left to reclaim. it just feels like i'm waiting for something to end.",
